## 🧭 IssueOps commands

| Command | Who | What it does |
| ------- | --- | ------------ |
| `.submit` | requestor | Confirms the validated request and starts approval (or execution when no approval is required). |
{{- if .QA }}
| `.answers` + `A1: …` lines | requestor | Answers clarifying questions. |
{{- end }}
| `.approve [note]` | eligible approvers | Approves the current submission. |
| `.deny <reason>` | eligible approvers | Denies and closes the request. |
| `.retry` | eligible approvers | Re-runs a failed execution of the same approved content. |
| `.cancel [reason]` | requestor or repository maintainers | Cancels the request. |
| `.status` | anyone | Shows validation, questions and approval progress. |

Commands must be the first word of the comment. Editing the issue body re-runs validation and voids approvals.

